    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533960/extras/37ba109927a1fba0b6f567fab7ea9237.poster.avif?t=1753882252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533960/extras/37ba109927a1fba0b6f567fab7ea9237.webm?t=1753882252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533960/extras/37ba109927a1fba0b6f567fab7ea9237.mp4?t=1753882252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SUMMERHOUSE is a small-scale building game and a love letter to the feeling of long lost summer afternoons.<br><br>Craft a neighbourhood of tiny, beautiful lived-in homes in a variety of settings: the sea, the city, or the mountains. While there are some little secrets to uncover, there are no rules, and you can\u2019t win or lose. Just chill out, build to your heart\u2019s content and soak up the atmosphere.<br><br>If relaxation and creation are your thing, this is a game for you :)<br><br><i>Please keep in mind that this is a small game with no goals or challenges, created by a single person\ud83d\ude42</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533960/extras/37ba109927a1fba0b6f567fab7ea9237.poster.avif?t=1753882252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533960/extras/37ba109927a1fba0b6f567fab7ea9237.webm?t=1753882252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533960/extras/37ba109927a1fba0b6f567fab7ea9237.mp4?t=1753882252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SUMMERHOUSE is a small-scale building game and a love letter to the feeling of long lost summer afternoons.<br><br>Craft a neighbourhood of tiny, beautiful lived-in homes in a variety of settings: the sea, the city, or the mountains. While there are some little secrets to uncover, there are no rules, and you can\u2019t win or lose. Just chill out, build to your heart\u2019s content and soak up the atmosphere.<br><br>If relaxation and creation are your thing, this is a game for you :)<br><br><i>Please keep in mind that this is a small game with no goals or challenges, created by a single person\ud83d\ude42</i>",
